{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52084","headline":"赐李百药 · 太宗皇帝李世民","name":"赐李百药","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"项弃范增善，纣妬比干才。\n嗟此二贤没，余喜得卿来。\n（《册府元龟》卷九七《帝王部·礼贤》。\n此首承陶敏先生录示。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"太宗皇帝李世民","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52084.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52084","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}